{"2254990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Permafrost", "steam_appid": 2254990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/f7dbf6cde63ce0ef3f2bac651958a2fa.avif?t=1787575377\" width=1440 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more wishlists, the bigger the launch discount! Add <strong>Permafrost</strong> to your wishlist and help unlock every tier, all the way to -30%.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a “Rook”; an engineer with the skills to rebuild, but little wilderness experience, drawn into this frozen, unforgiving world by a radio signal from a long-lost friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a grounded, story-driven open-world survival set in a near-future Earth locked in endless winter after a series of catastrophes that culminated in the shattering of the moon. As a solo player or together with up to 3 friends, explore frozen cities and wilderness, survive brutal weather, navigate faction-controlled territories, hunt, scavenge, craft, and build a network of shelters to endure this post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1787575377\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras_big/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1787575377 width=1560 height=28 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE COLD IS YOUR TRUE ENEMY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/91af9a964b90154263af522d382e4fec.poster.avif?t=1787575377\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/91af9a964b90154263af522d382e4fec.webm?t=1787575377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/91af9a964b90154263af522d382e4fec.mp4?t=1787575377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cold is alive and ever-present. Frostbite, storms, and creeping chill shape every journey, turning preparation, shelter, and timing into matters of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1787575377\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras_big/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1787575377 width=1560 height=28 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A FROZEN OPEN WORLD TO EXPLORE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/9cb5dd5a5ae59a093b031f1bee7e8cea.poster.avif?t=1787575377\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/9cb5dd5a5ae59a093b031f1bee7e8cea.webm?t=1787575377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/9cb5dd5a5ae59a093b031f1bee7e8cea.mp4?t=1787575377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a frozen open world where city ruins fade into wilderness. A tense, grounded survival experience shaped by silence and scarcity - no constant gunfire, no fantasy tropes. Just winter, isolation, and resolve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1787575377\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras_big/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1787575377 width=1560 height=28 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLORATION-GATED PROGRESSION!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/38ab03bab3ed26a78f5577fd059f89ec.poster.avif?t=1787575377\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/38ab03bab3ed26a78f5577fd059f89ec.webm?t=1787575377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/38ab03bab3ed26a78f5577fd059f89ec.mp4?t=1787575377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is earned through exploration and adaptation. Restore abandoned shelters, repair broken machines, and reclaim fragile technology to push deeper into the frozen world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1787575377\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras_big/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1787575377 width=1560 height=28 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOUR DOG AS YOUR LOYAL COMPANION!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" 